    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast pace Kung Fu fighting at your fingertips.  Choose your style and battle your way to victory.  Inspired by classic Hong Kong action cinema you will use your </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >entire body as a weapon.  Parry and dodge incoming attacks.... strike hard and fast to overcome your opponent.  Solve the mystery of the grandmaster and discover new fighters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767870/extras/aa347aec5f3f4e624b9a505c3537f4cb.avif?t=1743675972\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fist of Kung Fu's gameplay puts the player is the shoes of a master.\u00a0 Fluidly transition between moves as you break through their defenses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767870/extras/95ef69a74c558ec2e9fb0c9c6b1e52bd.avif?t=1743675972\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight online as you challenge players from around the globe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast pace Kung Fu fighting at your fingertips.  Choose your style and battle your way to victory.  Inspired by classic Hong Kong action cinema you will use your </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >entire body as a weapon.  Parry and dodge incoming attacks.... strike hard and fast to overcome your opponent.  Solve the mystery of the grandmaster and discover new fighters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767870/extras/aa347aec5f3f4e624b9a505c3537f4cb.avif?t=1743675972\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fist of Kung Fu's gameplay puts the player is the shoes of a master.\u00a0 Fluidly transition between moves as you break through their defenses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767870/extras/95ef69a74c558ec2e9fb0c9c6b1e52bd.avif?t=1743675972\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight online as you challenge players from around the globe.</p>",
